Grafana:  
      Grafana is an open-source visualization and monitoring platform.

It does not collect metrics itself. Instead, it connects to data sources like:

Prometheus
Loki
Elasticsearch
InfluxDB
MySQL
PostgreSQL
AWS CloudWatch
Azure Monitor

Grafana queries those data sources and displays the results as dashboards.


